` to be built from drifted leaf inputs even though the manifests still appear authoritative; verify each packet, bundle, and evidence hash before using their contents.\n    \n\n<details> <summary>ℹ️ About Codex in GitHub</summary>\n<br/>\n\n[Your team has set up Codex to review pull requests in this repo](https://chatgpt.com/codex/cloud/settings/general). Reviews are triggered when you\n- Open a pull request for review\n- Mark a draft as ready\n- Comment \"@codex review\".\n\nIf Codex has suggestions, it will comment; otherwise it will react with 👍.\n\n\n\n\nCodex can also answer questions or update the PR. Try commenting \"@codex address that feedback\".\n            \n</details>","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1660#pullrequestreview-4750508503","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1660","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1660#pullrequestreview-4750508503"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1660"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-22T02:39:05Z","commit_id":"6373c7de59819bd96e491adb77f04e713ae019d3"},{"id":4750821190,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOO5D6p88AAAABGyvHRg","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sa